      "Coolant (if not reusing)"
    ],
    "procedure_overview": [
      "Drain coolant",
      "Remove air filter housing for access",
      "Disconnect electrical connectors",
      "Remove water pump mounting bolts",
      "Remove thermostat housing and thermostat",
      "Install new thermostat with new seal",
      "Install new water pump with new seal",
      "Refill and bleed coolant system",
      "Test for leaks and proper operation"
    ],
    "notes": [
      "Electric water pump runs after engine shutoff - normal behavior",
      "After replacement, pump may need initialization via ISTA",
      "Replace thermostat whenever replacing water pump"
    ]
